-- On the application, in a summary way, of the corporation, or of any creditor or stockholder (member, for a
-- nonstock corporation), or of a receiver appointed under section 291 or of trustees in dissolution or a receiver
-- appointed under section 279 (pieces dg9), a court of equitable jurisdiction within Delaware may order a meeting
-- of the creditors or class, and/or of the stockholders or class, to be summoned as it directs. Any other
-- applicant is not covered (NOTHING). The court's order is its own decision: this rule says only who may apply.
-- src:51 | Whenever a compromise or arrangement is proposed between this corporation and its creditors or any class of them and/or between this corporation and its stockholders or any class of them, any court of equitable jurisdiction within the State of Delaware may, on the application in a summary way of this corporation or of any creditor or stockholder thereof or on the application of any receiver or receivers appointed for this corporation under § 291 of …
-- src:53 | Whenever a compromise or arrangement is proposed between this corporation and its creditors or any class of them and/or between this corporation and its members or any class of them, any court of equitable jurisdiction within the State of Delaware may, on the application in a summary way of this corporation or of any creditor or member thereof or on the application of any receiver or receivers appointed for this corporation under § 291 of …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(b)(2) (src:51) (src:53)
GIVEN kind IS A `Kind of corporation`
      applicant IS AN Actor
      `the certificate of incorporation contains the compromise or arrangement provision` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the receiver or trustee was appointed for this corporation under § 291 or § 279` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(b)(2) the applicant may apply for a meeting to be summoned` kind applicant `the certificate of incorporation contains the compromise or arrangement provision` `the receiver or trustee was appointed for this corporation under § 291 or § 279` MEANS
    -- out of range: sections 291 and 279 (piece dg9) say how a receiver or a trustee is appointed
    IF NOT (`the certificate of incorporation contains the compromise or arrangement provision`)
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE CONSIDER applicant
         WHEN `the corporation` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `a creditor` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `a stockholder` THEN JUST (NOT (`the kind is a nonstock corporation` kind))
         WHEN `a member of a nonstock corporation` THEN JUST (`the kind is a nonstock corporation` kind)
         WHEN `a receiver` THEN JUST `the receiver or trustee was appointed for this corporation under § 291 or § 279`
         WHEN `a trustee` THEN JUST `the receiver or trustee was appointed for this corporation under § 291 or § 279`
         OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- If a majority in number representing three fourths in value of the creditors or class of creditors, and/or of the
-- stockholders (members) or class, agree to the compromise or arrangement and any reorganization, and the court
-- sanctions them, they bind all of the creditors or class, and/or stockholders or class, and the corporation.
-- The text does not say whether the majority in number is of all the persons in the class or of those voting:
-- the counts are the caller's, taken as the persons the caller counts (Fork register). "Three fourths in value"
-- is read as at least three fourths. NOTHING if the counts cannot be a vote.
-- src:51 | the application of any receiver or receivers appointed for this corporation under § 291 of Title 8 of the Delaware Code or on the application of trustees in dissolution or of any receiver or receivers appointed for this corporation under § 279 of Title 8 of the Delaware Code order a meeting of the creditors or class of creditors, and/or of the stockholders or class of stockholders of this corporation, as the case may be, to be summoned in such manner as the said court directs. If a majority in …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(b)(2) (src:51)
GIVEN `the number of creditors or stockholders (members) in the class who agree` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of creditors or stockholders (members) in the class` IS A NUMBER
      `the value represented by those who agree` IS A NUMBER
      `the total value of the class` IS A NUMBER
      `the court to which the application has been made has sanctioned the compromise or arrangement and the reorganization` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(b)(2) the compromise or arrangement and the reorganization are binding on all` `the number of creditors or stockholders (members) in the class who agree` `the number of creditors or stockholders (members) in the class` `the value represented by those who agree` `the total value of the class` `the court to which the application has been made has sanctioned the compromise or arrangement and the reorganization` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the vote carries` (`a majority of` (`another base named in the provision` "the creditors or class of creditors, and/or the stockholders or class of stockholders, in number")) `the number of creditors or stockholders (members) in the class who agree` `the number of creditors or stockholders (members) in the class`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST byNumber THEN
        CONSIDER `the vote carries` (`at least` (3 DIVIDED BY 4) `of` (`another base named in the provision` "the creditors or class of creditors, and/or the stockholders or class of stockholders, in value")) `the value represented by those who agree` `the total value of the class`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
        WHEN JUST byValue THEN JUST (byNumber AND byValue AND `the court to which the application has been made has sanctioned the compromise or arrangement and the reorganization`)

